The game is to choose your own path of the adventure game and experiencing the outcome of story. 

Starting point in the story:
Description: The player would wake up in the dark forest and will be given to options to choose.
Choices: - Seek for help
         - Walk down path.

Description: The player sees the bear and he has to decide two of the options.
Choices: - Fight the bear
         - Run away

Description: You are walking through the path and suddenly sees an old lady laughing loudly with a map in her hand, will you accept it? You have to choose either of the two options.
Choices:  - Accept map
          - Refuse map